Package: armonia
Title: Harmonize Multilingual and Longitudinal Research Data
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Irene", "Cruz", email = "irene.cruz@uab.cat", role = c("aut", "cre")), 
    person("Alejandro", "González Heras", email = "alejo.heras.vision@gmail.com", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Tools for harmonizing multilingual and multi-wave research datasets.
    Generates an Excel-based data dictionary that maps raw variable names and
    categorical values to a standardized schema, applies the mapping
    to rename variables and recode factors to integers, safely row-binds and
    column-binds waves, and anonymizes participant identifiers via salted
    SHA-256 hashing.
